  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1904.07 Department Initiated Changes to Established Protected Instream Flows",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1904.07 Department Initiated Changes to Established Protected Instream Flows. The department shall initiate action, in accordance with Env-Wq 1904.01, to reconsider a designated river’s established protected instream flow if the department determines that the protected instream flows were based on incomplete or erroneous information.\n\nSource. #7901, eff 5-29-03 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1900), ss by #9936, eff 5-28-11; ss by #12695, eff 12-22-18 (formerly Env-Wq 1905.05(i))",
